  "longBusinessSummary": "Lechwerke AG, together with its subsidiaries, operates as an energy supplier in Germany. The company supplies electricity and gas to home private and commercial customers, business customers, municipalities, and energy solutions. It also supplies electricity from renewable energies, including hydropower, solar and wind power, and geothermal and biomass energy; heat electricity; solar energy; and e-mobility services. In addition, it offers energy inspections, maintenance, and repairs services; telecommunications; fibre optics; energy consulting and LED lighting systems. The company was founded in 1903 and is based in Augsburg, Germany. Lechwerke AG operates as a subsidiary of innogy SE.",
